6-04-10T15:21:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821310466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2939450-1826992588596272","game_id":"steam-2939450","kind":"update","title":"DEMO PATCH 1.0","summary":"Dear followers,First of all, I want to thank you for adding Inherited Shadows to your wishlist and for playing the demo.The reception so far has been very positive, and I truly appreciate it.A few small bugs were reported thanks to the feedback received, and a new patch is now live fixing the following issues:1. Inventory item viewer issue: When inspecting an item in the viewer, using TAB / Y / Triangle to close it instead of ESC / B / Circle would close only the inventory, leaving the item visi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-13T17:13:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588596272","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2939450-1826992588588793","game_id":"steam-2939450","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is Live!","summary":"🔥 The demo for Inherited Shadows is finally live! 🔥I’m very excited to finally put this first part of Amanda’s journey in your hands, and I truly hope you enjoy exploring this small glimpse of her story. ⚠️ But before you dive into the shadows, I'd like you to take into account the following:❤️ FeedbackI’d really love to hear your general feedback: what you think about the game so far, what you enjoyed, and what you believe could be improved. Your feedback is incredibly valuable as development c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-11T00:10:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588588793","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2939450-1826362059919497","game_id":"steam-2939450","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO RELEASE DATE","summary":"Hello everyone,First of all, thank you for your patience and for supporting Inherited Shadows.I'm excited to finally announce that the demo will launch this Friday, March 6 at 2 PM EST.Expect:• Atmospheric exploration • Puzzles and investigation • A glimpse of the horrors lurking in the shadowsThis is just the beginning of Amanda’s story.If you enjoy the demo, please consider adding the game to your wishlist — it helps the project more than you can imagine.Thank you again for all the support.I c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-04T21:54:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826362059919497","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2939450-1825727806711797","game_id":"steam-2939450","kind":"update","title":"Demo Release Update","summary":"Hello everyone!The Inherited Shadows demo was scheduled to launch today at 2PM. However, it is currently still under review by Steam. I'm awaiting final approval, and it should be available very soon.I'm really excited for you to experience the demo and truly appreciate your patience in the meantime.Thank you so much for your support! 🖤-Juan","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-27T19:04:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1825727806711797","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2939450-1824644522846143","game_id":"steam-2939450","kind":"announcement","title":"Step Into Amanda’s Nightmare – Demo Com